{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_08",
  "title": "種因",
  "storyCode": "HS-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c0d854eac276cf435e777940ab7cf4eb1cb39016c22f6bb26beff9ddb63a6b71",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "數量還是太多了……對付不過來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "外圍的田地，恐怕都要保不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "情況緊急，優先救人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "是錯覺嗎，總覺得……它們鬧得好像沒有之前兇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "什麼動靜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "這裡的地塊，正在從核心城上脫離……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "果然……這些怪物的生命力與大荒城的核心城是綁定的，斷開了連接，它們的力量也在衰弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "堅持住！大家都撤到這裡來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "通知都已經送到了，各區域的人都到齊了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職農組長甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "子至卯號居民區人員到齊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職農組長乙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1250_1",
      "text": "申至亥號居民區人員到齊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職農組長丙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "巳至未號居民區人員到齊，派去辰號居民區的人還沒有消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "職農組長丙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "從中央城區到辰號居民區的路上，有一片農田受到怪獸攻擊的情況格外嚴重，派出去的救援隊也失去聯絡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "現在核心城能源裝置故障，聯絡系統也癱瘓了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "我去找人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "每次都是你拉著我不要逞能，怎麼你跑得比誰都快。誰知道別處還有多少怪物，你打算一個人去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "那裡是我的試驗田，沒人比我更熟路線！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "留在那裡的，都是平時受我委託幫我照顧農地的職農。我還騙了他們，說我的研究最近大有進展……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "要去也行，帶我一個。我跑得快，還能拉你一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "你是外地來的，這裡的事原本跟你沒關係，你還比我小一歲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "“……禾生，1101年晉升天師府中級農業天師，當時十七歲。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "來大荒城查資料的時候，翻過天師府的名冊，算下來，你比我小一歲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "禾生兄弟，危難關頭，勿要逞強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "*炎國粗口*，你平常都這麼講話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "*炎國粗口*，我從來沒這樣講過話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "少廢話，一起走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "神話是一個謊言嗎？\n迷離的稻田綿延到天邊，這是一片生命的沃野。\n長風吹徹，稻浪如歌。\n一個初生的意識在此孕育，有一個聲音向她搭話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看起來很疲憊，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "原來……你已經醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是哪裡？我從一開始就在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼，有很久遠的記憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看到了許多……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戰亂，死亡，疫病，飢荒……\n來自穹頂之上的災異翻洗整片大地，滿目瘡痍，之後又是無止盡的戰亂動盪。\n文明毀滅，生靈恐懼。\n為什麼我會被困在這裡？\n我到底是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我覺得，很害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "外面，很恐怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混沌的意識",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我聽到，有許多人在哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怎樣才能不再這樣痛苦下去。\n我想起來了，有人給我取了名字……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“歲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雜草瘋長，淹沒了所有土地。\n萬古長夜凝結在這一瞬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "不，你只是一個影子……是我自己的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "這些並非你的痛苦，是生活在這片土地上的人的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "你在害怕，因為你不曾真的活過，你不知道這片大地真實的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "這世間並不可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是你不曾見過莊稼豐收，人們歡聲笑語的樣子。\n你不曾見過萬類競生，歷經磨難，卻依然生生不息的樣子。\n如果有機會，你應該仔細看看。\n我早已不是那傲慢孤單的巨獸，也並非飄蕩無依的遊魂。\n我已真實地活過，與大地上萬千生靈一同。\n一滴露水滴下，為大地注入跨越無數時間的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "text": "睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "這裡！救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊！別過來！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "……嗬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇異的織物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "text": "（嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強作鎮定的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "得……得救了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "王伯！你怎麼還在這？你們沒事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強作鎮定的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "小禾！我就知道你一定會過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強作鎮定的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "*炎國粗口*，不知道從哪冒出來這麼些畜生，到處啃莊稼，嚇我一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強作鎮定的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1249_1",
      "text": "但你放心！這片試驗田我們守得好好的，一隻怪物都沒放過去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "王伯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "還好……只是驚嚇過度暈過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "整片田地正在一點點地陷落下去，遠方已經可以看到田地間的巨大裂縫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "通訊設備全都失效了，土木天師不知道這裡還有人，他們已經開始拆除連接了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "趕快走，再晚就來不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1250_1",
      "text": "好深的一道溝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的職農",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1250_1",
      "text": "我們……是已經被拋下了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "……得罪了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年秉燭人一手攜起一人，騰身而起，三兩步跨過溝壑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "你……真有你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左樂來往在兩塊分錯開的地塊之間，將落單的人們一一送到安全的對岸。\n但是地塊之間的高低差還在以肉眼可見的速度擴大，他的腳步也逐漸變得沉重。\n直到最後一次，他差一點就要踏空，一陣風托住了他的背。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "當心點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "多謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "其他人都送過去了，抓緊我，我帶你上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的織物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "text": "（嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "……還有？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "別分神……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你源石技藝使用過頭了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "用不著擔心我……天師府的學生，沒你想的那麼脆弱……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人合力擊退了幾隻怪物，可就在耽誤的片刻工夫，眼前兩塊地塊間的高低落差又擴大了不少。\n足有四五丈的距離，對兩人來說就是天塹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "……該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "我們……是不是走不了了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "這個地塊馬上就要陷落了，做好防衝擊的準備……找一處泥土鬆軟的土地躲起來，說不定還能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "之前都沒有注意，大荒城的移動地塊居然已經建得這麼高了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "左樂……我們救下了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你放心，我清點過人數，之前困在這裡的人都已經送過去了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "打起精神，只要我們想辦法活著回去，這趟救援就算圓滿成功了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "神話裡總是說，當年無論情況多麼艱險，只要大家站在一起，總能把危機渡過去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "這些年，一直在受大家的照顧……但從來沒能做點回報大家的事，今天總算……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "禾生的聲音斷斷續續，左樂這才意識到，他的白色衣衫上湮出了一片鮮紅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你受傷了？！什麼時候——我幫你止血！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "左樂，送你一樣東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "這個時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "這是我的天師儀，裡面還存著一些重要的實驗資料，一會不管發生了什麼事，你都要想辦法保管好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "好吧……我收著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "禾生將一塊源石裝置牢牢綁在左樂手上，按動了開關，小巧的裝置迅速展開為一面風箏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你要做什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "雖然之前一直在罵你，但我發現，你心眼不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "所以我不能，讓你在這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年用盡最後一絲力氣，一陣疾風吹起。左樂還沒反應過來，身體便被風箏帶著飛上了半空。\n下方地塊一點點地墜落，禾生的身影也一點點地小了下去。可左樂又分明看到，田間殘餘的幾隻詭異的怪物撲向了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詭異的織物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "text": "（威脅的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "雖然不知道你們到底是從哪裡冒出來的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "但我可不怕你們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "咦……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的牧獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "text": "哞——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醒醒？醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，聽得到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好像還有呼吸，都讓開點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "綿綿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫順的牧獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "text": "（關切地磨蹭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "別……別舔我了……我身上沒有零食……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "禾生緩緩睜開眼，他發現自己正躺在田野間，有許多張擔憂的臉孔環繞著自己。\n他彷彿回到了並不存在於記憶裡的那一天，初次來到這片土地的那一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "大家……都沒事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "大家都想去找你的時候，綿綿不知道從哪裡馱著你回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你那時為什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "……你救了我，多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "那些怪物……被趕跑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "烏雲散去，血色的晚霞褪了色，又是一輪夕陽，金黃色的餘暉灑滿田野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "結……結束了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "結束了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "我們贏了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "當年，神農做到的事，我們也做到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "是啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "有人控制住了核心能源，我們成功了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "回頭看看，這不也是一段新的神話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "沒事了，我們回去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "等等！我該不是眼花了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "那是……甲辰號地塊……“萬頃”的試驗田！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不遠處，荒蕪的田地裡，兀然立著一株稻子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "左樂！幫我一把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你怎麼還要回去？前面很危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "成功了，成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "text": "萬頃良田……有希望，有希望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年欣喜地抱著一株稻子，笑得有點瘋癲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "你到底……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "“說了你也聽不懂”，是吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "就當你是真的找到希望了吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "那些蟲子生長的時候總要渡過一劫，渡得過去的，破繭而出；渡不過去的，生命就在一片昏暗裡悄無聲息地停止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "毀滅新生，任何生命都逃不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "他到底想要做什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "“巨獸心臟”……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "又見面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "左公子既然找到了這裡，看來是琢磨明白了我的打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "……你在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "如你所見，織布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "織布做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "布料織好了，當然是要拿來賣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "賣給誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "不能洩漏客人訊息，行業規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "text": "布上的東西……是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "山河百景……或者用你們的話說，炎國的“國祚”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "我用了許多年，走遍了炎國每一座城市，大荒城，是最後一座。直到今天，這匹布，才算織完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "text": "越美的圖案，當然要用越好的染料為絲線染色。要織就這一幅山河百景圖，哪有比大炎國祚更好的染料呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "數不清的綢緞彷彿是從天上墜下，每一匹綢緞，都是一座城市，一段歷史，一方人間煙火。\n國祚？不……應該是人心才對。\n你看這些錦緞上的華彩，都是我見過的人心的顏色。\n我怎會不喜歡這人間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
